  "cards": [
    {
      "id": "quantity-wy27-s12-t02-drill-01-question",
      "type": "question",
      "title": "实战精刷 · 第1题",
      "question": {
        "id": "quantity-wy27-s12-t02-drill-01",
        "type": "single",
        "stem": "（26福建事考）书柜中有5本书，编号分别为1到5。现随机不放回逐本取出，则恰好按照编号从小到大顺序取出的概率是（）。",
        "options": [
          {
            "value": "A",
            "label": "1/120"
          },
          {
            "value": "B",
            "label": "1/60"
          },
          {
            "value": "C",
            "label": "1/30"
          },
          {
            "value": "D",
            "label": "1/5"
          }
        ],
        "answer": "A",
        "sourceAnswer": "A"
      },
      "source": {
        "type": "pdf",
        "documentId": "quantity-wy27",
        "title": "王炎·27数量关系大满贯·讲义",
        "pages": [
          128
        ],
        "printedPages": [
          122
        ],
        "originalImages": [
          {
            "src": "assets/images/courses/quantity-wy27/quantity-wy27-s12-t02-drill-01-p128.webp",
            "alt": "概率问题（一） · 实战精刷1 · 讲义第122页",
            "pdfPage": 128
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "quantity-wy27-s12-t02-drill-01-explanation-01",
      "type": "text",
      "role": "explanation",
      "title": "我们这样分析",
      "questionId": "quantity-wy27-s12-t02-drill-01",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "讲义参考答案：A"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "我们先看取书顺序。5本不同的书有5!=120种等可能排列，符合题意的只有1、2、3、4、5这一种。"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "因此概率为1/120，我们选A。也可以按每一步取到指定书的概率相乘：1/5×1/4×1/3×1/2×1。"
        },
        {
          "type": "formula",
          "latex": "P=\\frac1{5!}=\\frac1{120}"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "这道题记住什么"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "完全指定的随机排列只有一种，概率是排列总数的倒数。"
        }
      ],
      "source": {
