    {
      "id": "quantity-wy27-s12-t02-drill-02-question",
      "type": "question",
      "title": "实战精刷 · 第2题",
      "question": {
        "id": "quantity-wy27-s12-t02-drill-02",
        "type": "single",
        "stem": "（25四川）教师从某班级学号为01—07的7名学生中随机抽出3名做值日，则这3名学生学号恰好为三个相邻自然数的概率为：",
        "options": [
          {
            "value": "A",
            "label": "1/7"
          },
          {
            "value": "B",
            "label": "1/6"
          },
          {
            "value": "C",
            "label": "1/5"
          },
          {
            "value": "D",
            "label": "1/4"
          }
        ],
        "answer": "A",
        "sourceAnswer": "A"
      },
      "source": {
        "type": "pdf",
        "documentId": "quantity-wy27",
        "title": "王炎·27数量关系大满贯·讲义",
        "pages": [
          128
        ],
        "printedPages": [
          122
        ],
        "originalImages": [
          {
            "src": "assets/images/courses/quantity-wy27/quantity-wy27-s12-t02-drill-02-p128.webp",
            "alt": "概率问题（一） · 实战精刷2 · 讲义第122页",
            "pdfPage": 128
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "quantity-wy27-s12-t02-drill-02-explanation-01",
      "type": "text",
      "role": "explanation",
      "title": "我们这样分析",
      "questionId": "quantity-wy27-s12-t02-drill-02",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "讲义参考答案：A"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "我们把连续的三人按最小学号枚举：01—03、02—04、03—05、04—06、05—07，一共5组。"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "7人中选3人总共有35种组合，不计抽出的先后顺序。"
        },
        {
          "type": "formula",
          "latex": "P=\\frac5{\\binom73}=\\frac17"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "所以概率5/35=1/7，我们选A。"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "这道题记住什么"
        }
      ],
      "source": {
