    {
      "id": "quantity-wy27-s12-t02-drill-03-question",
      "type": "question",
      "title": "实战精刷 · 第3题",
      "question": {
        "id": "quantity-wy27-s12-t02-drill-03",
        "type": "single",
        "stem": "（26河南事考）某单位共有23名职工，从所有职工中随机选出4人参加会议，正好选出3名女性职工和正好选出2名女性职工的概率相同。问正好选出1名女性职工的概率在以下哪个范围内？",
        "options": [
          {
            "value": "A",
            "label": "不到0.1"
          },
          {
            "value": "B",
            "label": "超过0.5"
          },
          {
            "value": "C",
            "label": "0.3—0.5之间"
          },
          {
            "value": "D",
            "label": "0.1—0.3之间"
          }
        ],
        "answer": "D",
        "sourceAnswer": "D"
      },
      "source": {
        "type": "pdf",
        "documentId": "quantity-wy27",
        "title": "王炎·27数量关系大满贯·讲义",
        "pages": [
          128,
          129
        ],
        "printedPages": [
          122,
          123
        ],
        "originalImages": [
          {
            "src": "assets/images/courses/quantity-wy27/quantity-wy27-s12-t02-drill-03-p128.webp",
            "alt": "概率问题（一） · 实战精刷3 · 讲义第122页",
            "pdfPage": 128
          },
          {
            "src": "assets/images/courses/quantity-wy27/quantity-wy27-s12-t02-drill-03-p129.webp",
            "alt": "概率问题（一） · 实战精刷3 · 讲义第123页",
            "pdfPage": 129
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "quantity-wy27-s12-t02-drill-03-explanation-01",
      "type": "text",
      "role": "explanation",
      "title": "我们这样分析",
      "questionId": "quantity-wy27-s12-t02-drill-03",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "讲义参考答案：D"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "我们设女性w人、男性m人，w+m=23。两种概率分母相同，有利组合数相等：3女1男与2女2男的组合数相等。"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "约分得到2(w−2)=3(m−1)。联立总人数23，解得女性14人、男性9人。"
        },
        {
          "type": "formula",
          "latex": "\\binom w3\\binom m1=\\binom w2\\binom m2,\\quad P=\\frac{\\binom{14}1\\binom93}{\\binom{23}4}\\approx0.133"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "恰好1女就是从14人中选1人、9人中选3人，概率1176/8855约0.133，落在0.1—0.3之间，我们选D。"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "这道题记住什么"
        }
      ],
