    {
      "id": "quantity-wy27-s12-t02-drill-04-question",
      "type": "question",
      "title": "实战精刷 · 第4题",
      "question": {
        "id": "quantity-wy27-s12-t02-drill-04",
        "type": "single",
        "stem": "（25联考）某公司甲部门男性员工比女性多2人，乙部门女性员工比男性多3人。已知甲、乙两部门女性员工共6人，问从甲、乙两部门中随机选出4人，恰好选到2名男员工和2名女员工的概率是：",
        "options": [
          {
            "value": "A",
            "label": "4/11"
          },
          {
            "value": "B",
            "label": "5/11"
          },
          {
            "value": "C",
            "label": "2/33"
          },
          {
            "value": "D",
            "label": "5/66"
          }
        ],
        "answer": "B",
        "sourceAnswer": "B"
      },
      "source": {
        "type": "pdf",
        "documentId": "quantity-wy27",
        "title": "王炎·27数量关系大满贯·讲义",
        "pages": [
          129
        ],
        "printedPages": [
          123
        ],
        "originalImages": [
          {
            "src": "assets/images/courses/quantity-wy27/quantity-wy27-s12-t02-drill-04-p129.webp",
            "alt": "概率问题（一） · 实战精刷4 · 讲义第123页",
            "pdfPage": 129
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "quantity-wy27-s12-t02-drill-04-explanation-01",
      "type": "text",
      "role": "explanation",
      "title": "我们这样分析",
      "questionId": "quantity-wy27-s12-t02-drill-04",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "讲义参考答案：B"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "我们先合并两个部门。甲男性=甲女性+2，乙男性=乙女性−3，所以男性总数=女性总数−1=5人，女性6人，共11人。"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "恰好2男2女，有利组合为5选2乘6选2，总组合为11选4。"
        },
        {
          "type": "formula",
          "latex": "P=\\frac{\\binom52\\binom62}{\\binom{11}4}=\\frac5{11}"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": "概率150/330=5/11，我们选B。题目没要求两个部门各选几人，不用额外按部门分类。"
        },
        {
          "type": "heading",
          "level": 3,
          "text": "这道题记住什么"
        }
      ],
